  unfold Cc_1RB1LC_1RC0RB_0LD1LB_1LA0LA, cden, P0_1RB1LC_1RC0RB_0LD1LB_1LA0LA, P1_1RB1LC_1RC0RB_0LD1LB_1LA0LA; cbn [c_st c_l c_h c_r].
  unfold sden; cbn [s_pre s_u s_a s_b s_post].
  replace (1 * j + 0) with j by lia.
