    intros p1 j1 E1.
    exact (firex_1RB1LD_0LC0RA_1LA0LC_1RB0RC [SCycL 4 0; SWin 2] (StD, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
