    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc lapil_1RB1LD_0LC0RB_1LA0LD_1LC1RC (StD, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1.
    exact (firex_1RB1LD_0LC0RB_1LA0LD_1LC1RC [SRotL 1; SWin 1; SCycL 3 0; SWin 2] (StD, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
Qed.

